{"source": "wikisource", "raw_id": "arwikisource:35688:254259#chunk_228", "reason": "high_symbol_ratio:0.409", "chunk_text": "وَأَمْسَوْا شُهَدَاء ."}
{"source": "wikisource", "raw_id": "arwikisource:35688:254259#chunk_237", "reason": "high_symbol_ratio:0.403", "chunk_text": "\" وَفِي السُّنَن إِنَّ أَبَا بَكْر وَعُمَر لَمِنْهُمْ وَأُنْعِمَا ."}
